# CISA Cross-Sector Cybersecurity Performance Goals (CPG) Checklist

Version: 2.0 draft preview  
Source: [CISA Cybersecurity Performance Goals 2.0](https://www.cisa.gov/cybersecurity-performance-goals-2-0-cpg-2-0)  
Companion source: [CISA Cybersecurity Performance Goals](https://www.cisa.gov/cybersecurity-performance-goals)  
Last Reviewed: 2026-08-30  
Maintained by: Repository maintainers

---

## Version 2.0 Update Notes

This checklist is organized around the NIST Cybersecurity Framework 2.0 functions:

1. Govern
2. Identify
3. Protect
4. Detect
5. Respond
6. Recover

CPG 2.0 emphasizes governance, accountability, managed service provider risk, least privilege, malicious code detection, adverse event identification, and incident communication procedures.

The following prior standalone goals have been removed from this checklist because CPG 2.0 reporting indicates that their outcomes were folded into broader goals:

- Vendor/Supplier Cybersecurity Requirements
- Detecting Relevant Threats and TTPs
- Deploy Security.txt Files

